ll_name','field_team_full_name'),(173,400,'role_title','Founder & Director'),(174,400,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(175,400,'short_bio','Nil S. Navaie, Founder and Director of Arts for Global Development, is a strategist, mixed-media artist, and author whose work operates at the intersection of culture, sustainability, health, and social impact. Drawing on over 20 years of international experience, she designs and leads cross-sector collaborations that connect local action with global dialogue, using creativity as a catalyst for positive human and ecological development.'),(176,400,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(177,400,'sort_order','10'),(178,400,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(179,401,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(180,401,'full_name','Elif Ertem'),(181,401,'_full_name','field_team_full_name'),(182,401,'role_title','Founding Board Member'),(183,401,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(184,401,'short_bio','Elif Ertem is a global marketing executive with nearly 30 years of experience leading brand, customer engagement, and growth strategies for international Fortune 500 companies. As a founding board member, she provides strategic guidance on storytelling, communications, and organizational development.'),(185,401,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(186,401,'sort_order','20'),(187,401,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(188,402,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(189,402,'full_name','Sabi Behzadi'),(190,402,'_full_name','field_team_full_name'),(191,402,'role_title','Board Member'),(192,402,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(193,402,'short_bio','Sabi Behzadi is a management consultant and social entrepreneur with extensive experience in global strategy, public policy, and cross-cultural partnerships across more than a dozen countries. She brings expertise in international collaboration and social innovation to the board.'),(194,402,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(195,402,'sort_order','30'),(196,402,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(197,403,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(198,403,'full_name','Kia Navai'),(199,403,'_full_name','field_team_full_name'),(200,403,'role_title','Founding Board Member'),(201,403,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(202,403,'short_bio','Kia Navaie is a technology leader specializing in healthcare IT, data infrastructure, and AI-driven systems integration. As a founding board member, he provides technical leadership, financial oversight, and operational support for the organization\'s programs and exhibitions.'),(203,403,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(204,403,'sort_order','40'),(205,403,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(206,404,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(207,404,'full_name','Melda Değirmenci'),(208,404,'_full_name','field_team_full_name'),(209,404,'role_title','Board Member'),(210,404,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(211,404,'short_bio','Melda Değirmenci is an attorney with distinguished experience advising global financial institutions on complex cross-border finance and restructuring matters. Her legal expertise and commitment to community service strengthen the organization\'s governance and strategic planning.'),(212,404,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(213,404,'sort_order','50'),(214,404,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(215,405,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(216,405,'full_name','Paul Guise'),(217,405,'_full_name','field_team_full_name'),(218,405,'role_title','Adviser'),(219,405,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(220,405,'short_bio','Paul Guise is a cultural consultant, music educator, and researcher who helps artists and cultural organizations build sustainable and impactful practices. His work combines business analytics, curriculum development, and creative leadership to support the cultural sector.'),(221,405,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(222,405,'sort_order','10'),(223,405,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(224,406,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(225,406,'full_name','Teresa Diaz'),(226,406,'_full_name','field_team_full_name'),(227,406,'role_title','Adviser'),(228,406,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(229,406,'short_bio','Teresa Diaz is an arts leader, curator, and educator with expertise in Latin American art, community engagement, and cultural programming. Through her work in galleries, museums, and philanthropy, she advances the role of the arts in education and social impact.'),(230,406,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(231,406,'sort_order','20'),(232,406,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(233,407,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(234,407,'full_name','Emon Surakitkoson'),(235,407,'_full_name','field_team_full_name'),(236,407,'role_title','Adviser'),(237,407,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(238,407,'short_bio','Emon Surakitkoson is a Thai-born artist whose work explores identity, memory, and cross-cultural experience through painting and sculpture. She brings a unique artistic perspective and commitment to global understanding through creativity and cultural exchange.'),(239,407,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(240,407,'sort_order','30'),(241,407,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(242,408,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(243,408,'full_name','Thuli Wolf'),(244,408,'_full_name','field_team_full_name'),(245,408,'role_title','Adviser'),(246,408,'_role_title','field_team_role_title'),(247,408,'short_bio','Thuli Wolf is a physician, artist, and art therapist who advocates for the role of creativity in health and well-being. Through her clinical, artistic, and educational work, she helps individuals and communities harness the transformative power of creative expression.'),(248,408,'_short_bio','field_team_short_bio'),(249,408,'sort_order','40'),(250,408,'_sort_order','field_team_sort_order'),(251,500,'_thumbnail_id','1'),(252,500,'pub_year','2010'),(253,500,'_pub_year','field_pub_year'),(254,500,'authors','Nil Şişmanyazıcı-Navaie'),(255,500,'_authors','field_pub_authors'),(256,500,'publisher','Arts for Global Development'),(257,500,'_publisher','field_pub_publisher'),(258,500,'_external_url','field_pub_ext